{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-fundamentals","title":"旅游学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-concept-system","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游的概念与产业体系","url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals/tourism-concept-system","wordCount":1735,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"tourist-behavior","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游者行为与消费决策","url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals/tourist-behavior","wordCount":1763,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"tourism-industry-structure","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游产业结构与参与者","url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals/tourism-industry-structure","wordCount":1794,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 旅游学基础\n\n本章建立对旅游这一现象的整体认识。我们先厘清\"旅游\"到底指什么、它由哪些要素构成、产业链条如何串联，再深入到旅游者的内心——他们为什么出行、如何做决策、不同人群有什么不同的需求。\n\n掌握这些基础概念，就像拿到了一张旅游产业的地图。后续章节讨论的资源开发、酒店运营、市场营销，都建立在对\"旅游者\"和\"旅游产业结构\"的理解之上。\n"}